            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG711 Magnetic Roller Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis brushed stainless steel finish roller catch uses a magnet to hold a door closed. The magnetic roller catch can be installed in the top, bottom, or side edge of a door. Packaged with installation screws and T-strike plate. Packaged complete with stainless steel flush bolt assembly, strike plate and mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG711_size.gif?v=1704354735\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG711-630 Magnetic Roller Catch\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of AHI SIG711-630 SIG711 Magnetic Roller Catch\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel / Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/2\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"  (21 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 7/8\" (23 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG711.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI SIG711 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
